[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8101.589, "timestamp": "02:15:01", "text": "好的，所以你现在有 217。217。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8104.47, "timestamp": "02:15:04", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8109.189, "timestamp": "02:15:09", "text": "。 你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8110.47, "timestamp": "02:15:10", "text": "想发动一次机会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8111.03, "timestamp": "02:15:11", "text": "攻击吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8112.87, "timestamp": "02:15:12", "text": "是的，我一定会抓住"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8113.83, "timestamp": "02:15:13", "text": "机会发动攻击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8115.75, "timestamp": "02:15:15", "text": "好的。 发动一次机会攻击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8119.109, "timestamp": "02:15:19", "text": "呃，让我死在那儿吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8120.069, "timestamp": "02:15:20", "text": "兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8122.709, "timestamp": "02:15:22", "text": "有可能。 您可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8123.189, "timestamp": "02:15:23", "text": "有可能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8125.83, "timestamp": "02:15:25", "text": "您可以。 有可能。 您可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8128.95, "timestamp": "02:15:28", "text": "兄弟，要这么晚了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8132.709, "timestamp": "02:15:32", "text": "好的。 好的。 呃，好的。 你做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8135.669, "timestamp": "02:15:35", "text": "嗯，没打中。 然后当你照做的时候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8137.51, "timestamp": "02:15:37", "text": "就像“我的天哪，我实际上无法在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8139.03, "timestamp": "02:15:39", "text": "这里选择衣柜”。 坚持，稍等。 让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8142.069, "timestamp": "02:15:42", "text": "赶紧把这件事办好。 好的。 呃，就在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8143.589, "timestamp": "02:15:43", "text": "你做那个动作的时候，我要把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8144.95, "timestamp": "02:15:44", "text": "你的衣柜往后挪一格，就为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8148.39, "timestamp": "02:15:48", "text": "能听清它的声音。 嗯，好的。 让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8149.99, "timestamp": "02:15:49", "text": "先做